# Next.js build output and the sources fumadocs-mdx generates from content/
.next
apps/docs/.source

# Regenerated by Next on every run, so tracking them only produces churn.
# next-env.d.ts points at .next/dev/types under `next dev` and .next/types
# under `next build`, so it flips depending on which ran last. AGENTS.md is
# Next 16's own agent boilerplate and CLAUDE.md is a pointer at it; `next dev`
# re-creates both, and neither is ours to keep.
apps/docs/next-env.d.ts
apps/docs/AGENTS.md
apps/docs/CLAUDE.md

# Generated from apps/api's OpenAPI spec on every docs build. Committing the
# pages would invite somebody to edit one the next build overwrites, and the
# copied spec is a build artifact of apps/api rather than a source file.
apps/docs/openapi.json
apps/docs/content/docs/api/
*.tsbuildinfo
